## API and Routing

- Rails controllers routes are defined in [config/routes.rb](mdc:config/routes.rb). Keep routes RESTful and namespaced when appropriate.
- The Ruby-based API is implemented in `lib/api/` with versioned endpoints and entities. Follow the existing namespace and versioning patterns.
- When adding or changing API endpoints, update documentation and tests in `spec/` accordingly.
- For frontend to backend communication during dev, the Angular CLI proxy in [frontend/cli_to_rails_proxy.js](mdc:frontend/cli_to_rails_proxy.js) forwards requests to Rails.
